OL,3,GNEWSABricks thrown at firefighters in
OL,4,A'reckless' attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters had rocks thrown at them
OL,7,Fin a "dangerous and unprovoked attack"
OL,8,Fwhile responding to a rubbish fire.
OL,10,FTyne and Wear Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fsaid a crew was called to Blakelaw, in
OL,12,FNewcastle, at about 21:40 BST on
OL,13,FWednesday when they had several items
OL,14,Fthrown at them.
OL,16,FThe force said no-one was injured, but
OL,17,Fa fire engine had to be taken off the
OL,18,Froad temporarily due to "significant
OL,19,Fdamage".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
