OL,3,GNEWSABricks thrown at firefighters in
OL,4,A'reckless' attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief fire officer Stewart Nicholson
OL,7,Fsaid the impact could not be
OL,8,Funderestimated, as firefighters were
OL,9,Fleft without one of their vehicles.
